# Shanling M0 Pro status bar skin
# 22px tall to match SYSFONT_HEIGHT (22-Terminus-Bold).
# Layout (left → right): battery%   play_state   HH:MM   hold?   vol-bar
#
# Preload icons (x,y are draw position relative to the rendering viewport)
%xl(P,playstate-sb-16x16.bmp,75,3,5)
%xl(L,hold-sb-16x16.bmp,150,3)
#
# Status bar viewport: full width, 22px tall, font 0 = UI font (theme: 22-Terminus-Bold)
%V(0,0,240,22,0)
%al%bl%%
%ac%cH:%cM
%pv(180,4,52,14,-)
%?mp<|%xd(Pb)|%xd(Pc)|%xd(Pd)|%xd(Pe)>
%?mh<%xd(L)>
#
# Main UI viewport — everything below the bar
%Vi(-,0,22,-,-,1)
